      "title": "Note: Streaming VSA INT8",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Ref2VA Streaming VSA INT8 (12GB Low-VRAM)\n\nThis workflow runs MiniMax H3 Reference-to-Video (Ref2VA) on 12GB VRAM GPUs (e.g. RTX 4070) by combining:\n\n1. **MATLOW Fused Turbo INT8 ConvRot** (Diffusion model)\n2. **MiniMaxChunkFeedForward** (chunks=4)\n3. **Ref2VA Streaming VSA Patch** (keep 5%, INT8 gate streamed per block from pinned CPU memory)\n4. **MiniMaxH3FastVAEDecode** (tile_batch_size=2)\n\n### Key Requirements:\n- `fasth3_vsa_gate.safetensors` in `ComfyUI/models/loras/`\n- `ComfyUI-KJNodes` (for ChunkFFN)\n- `ComfyUI-MiniMax-H3-MotionCache-FastVAE` (for Fast VAE)\n- ComfyUI with core Sparse Attention support (`comfy_extras.nodes_sparse_attention`)\n\nDrag & drop your 3 reference images into Reference 1, 2, 3 nodes!"
      ],
      "color": "#223",
      "bgcolor": "#112"
    },
